 DK8251
 DK8251.The coordinates were established by GPS observations
 DK8251.and adjusted by the National Geodetic Survey in April 2025.
 DK8251
 DK8251.NAD 83(2011) refers to NAD 83 coordinates where the reference frame has 
 DK8251.been affixed to the stable North American Tectonic Plate. 
 DK8251
 DK8251.The coordinates are valid at the epoch date displayed above
 DK8251.which is a decimal equivalence of Year/Month/Day.
 DK8251
 DK8251.NGS completed the third reprocessing of daily RINEX data from 1996 to 2022
 DK8251.for all stations in the NOAA CORS Network (NCN).  The reprocessed solution,
 DK8251.known as the Multi-Year CORS Solution 3 (MYCS3), is aligned with the
 DK8251.ITFR2020 global frame, epoch 2020.00.  The resulting MYCS3 coordinates
 DK8251.were then transformed to NAD83(2011/MA11/PA11), maintaining the currently
 DK8251.published epoch of 2010.00.
 DK8251
 DK8251.Additional information on MYCS is available at:
 DK8251.https://geodesy.noaa.gov/CORS/index.shtml
